    timerSeconds: 0
  - headerText: Quantum Entanglement
    bodyText: 'In a quantum system, a unique phenomenon can occur where two or more
      particles become connected (or entangled) in such a way that they instantly
      affect each other, regardless of the physical distance between them. They can
      even be separated by light-years at opposite ends of the universe and still
      influence one another instantaneously.


      In this game, you can use entanglement
      to solve complex puzzles!'
    illustrationMode: 0
    illustration: {fileID: 0}
